    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits the person from leaving Australia to avoid giving evidence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The person has been ordered to deliver their passport to the Integrity Commissioner.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The authorized officer may apply for a warrant to arrest the person.";
