    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Recurring";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Recurring trace of the person's attempts to evade service of summons.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The authorized officer has reasonable grounds to believe that the person is likely to abscond or is otherwise attempting, or likely to attempt, to evade service of the summons.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The authorized officer may apply for a warrant to arrest the person if they have not complied with the order or are likely to leave Australia to avoid giving evidence.";
